          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The right amount of protein must be included in the diet of growing children for their proper growth and development. Which of these food components are part of your daily diet?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
